# Caching rules for Netlify / Cloudflare Pages (Week 4): long cache for static assets, always revalidate HTML
/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/data/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
/*.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
